[h2]Build 0.9.22[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]SÄNKA conversation pit floor[/b]: drag out a sunken conversation pit in any shape. The carpet takes the fabric or leather it's built from, and the step-down walls and rim run round the outside of the shape. Furniture can stand on it, so a coffee table fits right in the middle.
[*][b]SÄNKA pit seat[/b]: built-in banquette seating for the pit. Drag a run of seats round the inside: they join into one long seat, turn corners, and lean their backs against the pit wall.
[/list]
